{"id":"a79a60a788ea47ca","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-finite-colimits.md","title":"thm-finite-colimits-in-topos","display":"thm-finite-colimits-in-topos","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-finite-colimits","aliases":["16-thm-finite-colimits","16-thm--finite-colimits"],"display":"thm-finite-colimits-in-topos","depends_on":["[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-regular-category]]"],"source":"Proposition 5.5.4 and proof, pp. 349–350 (PDF 369–370); exactness convention p. 297 (PDF 317)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-finite-colimits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-finite-colimits</span><span>16-thm--finite-colimits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-colimits-in-topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 5.5.4 and proof, pp. 349–350 (PDF 369–370); exactness convention p. 297 (PDF 317)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a> 的反范畴构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegCat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinColim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinColim}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Exact}\">\\(\\mathrm{Exact}\\)</span> 在下文定义；Exact 沿用原书 p. 297 的“正则且有余等化子”用法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:A\\rightrightarrows B\">\\(f,g:A\\rightrightarrows B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:B\\to Q\">\\(q:B\\to Q\\)</span> 是候选箭头；所有无显式下标的 Hom 取当前范畴。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g;q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nqf=qg\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal E(B,Z))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(hf=hg\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!k\\in\\mathcal E(Q,Z))\\ kq=h\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinColim}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Exact}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f,g\\in\\mathcal E(A,B))\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal E(B,Q))\\\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g;q).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g;q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nqf=qg\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal E(B,Z))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(hf=hg\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!k\\in\\mathcal E(Q,Z))\\ kq=h\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinColim}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Exact}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f,g\\in\\mathcal E(A,B))\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal E(B,Q))\\\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g;q).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{FinColim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Exact}(\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{FinColim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Exact}(\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里的有限余极限按反范畴的有限极限完整定义。原书 p. 297 使用的 Exact 只在本页按“正则且有余等化子”解释；本页没有凭该名称额外断言另一惯例下的有效等价关系条件。</li>\n<li>Proposition 5.5.4 的证明先使用严格初对象，再把两个单元素/空子集嵌入幂对象积并取并，构造二元余积。对一般关系先取最小包含等价关系，其分类箭头的像分解给出商；覆盖对单态射的正交性给出余等化泛性质。初对象、二元余积和余等化子构造全部有限余极限。</li>\n<li>topos 的像分解及其拉回稳定性给正则性，有限极限由定义已有。因此结论中的 Exact 由正则性和上述余等化子成立；原书还证明这些有限余极限沿拉回保持，本页未新增该更强结论。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Proposition 5.5.4 and proof, pp. 349–350（PDF 369–370）；Definition 5.4.1, p. 339（PDF 359）；Exact 用法见 Proposition 4.8.6 后 p. 297（PDF 317）。原书证明引用的像分解与正交性使用 §4.4；本轮核对所述构造和论证，未作机器证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-category","status":"resolved","id":"8727007e6f227c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的反范畴构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的反范畴构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的反范畴构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-category","status":"resolved","id":"8727007e6f227c84","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$ 采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]。$\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathrm{FinColim}$、$\\mathrm{Exact}$ 在下文定义；Exact 沿用原书 p. 297 的“正则且有余等化子”用法。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinLim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinColim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Exact}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:A\\rightrightarrows B","display":false},{"tex":"q:B\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g;q)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nqf=qg\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal E(B,Z))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\bigl(hf=hg\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!k\\in\\mathcal E(Q,Z))\\ kq=h\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinColim}(\\mathcal E)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Exact}(\\mathcal E)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f,g\\in\\mathcal E(A,B))\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal E(B,Q))\\\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g;q).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{FinColim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Exact}(\\mathcal E).","display":true}],"bytes":2996,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-424","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-finite-colimits|thm-finite-colimits-in-topos]]"}],"outgoing":["3744a99e6a5c0037","b75e7c168ac56b22","fc49efccd7348d66","8727007e6f227c84"]}